{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":223292,"duration_api_ms":224308,"num_turns":140,"result":"## Ralph Session Summary - GraphQL Backend Complete! ✅\n\n### Completed This Session\n\n**GraphQL Resolvers Implementation - graphql_resolvers.cljs**\n\nSuccessfully added all The Backroom GraphQL resolvers to complete the backend infrastructure:\n\n**Query Resolvers Added (10 new resolvers):**\n- ✅ `council-seat-query-resolver` - Fetch single council seat by index\n- ✅ `search-council-seats-query-resolver` - Paginated council seats with active filter & sorting\n- ✅ `ari-proposal-query-resolver` - Fetch single ARI proposal by ID\n- ✅ `search-ari-proposals-query-resolver` - Paginated proposals with status/type filters\n- ✅ `bounty-query-resolver` - Fetch single bounty by ID\n- ✅ `search-bounties-query-resolver` - Paginated bounties with sorting\n- ✅ `grant-query-resolver` - Fetch single grant by ID\n- ✅ `search-grants-query-resolver` - Paginated grants with recipient filter\n- ✅ `council-stake-history-resolver` - Fetch stake history with filters\n- ✅ `council-stake-balance-resolver` - Fetch current balance for staker/seat\n\n**Field Resolvers Added (8 computed field resolvers):**\n- ✅ `council-seat->stake-percentage` - Computes seat's % of total council stake\n- ✅ `council-seat->staked-by` - Lookup specific staker's balance on seat\n- ✅ `ari-proposal->veto-percentage` - Computes veto stake as % of total\n- ✅ `ari-proposal->proposal-type` - Converts int to GraphQL enum\n- ✅ `ari-proposal->status` - Converts int to GraphQL enum\n- ✅ `bounty->status` - Converts int to GraphQL enum\n- ✅ `grant->remaining` - Computes remaining vesting amount\n- ✅ 4 list item resolvers for pagination\n\n**Integration:**\n- ✅ Extended `Query` map via `Query-backroom` merge (preserves existing TCR queries)\n- ✅ Added 5 type resolver maps (CouncilSeat, ARIProposal, Bounty, Grant, and their List types)\n- ✅ Updated `resolvers-map` with all Backroom types\n- ✅ All resolvers follow existing patterns (paged-query, try-catch-throw, enum conversion)\n\n**Documentation:**\n- ✅ Updated @fix_plan.md to mark GraphQL as complete\n- ✅ Added Key Learnings about GraphQL resolver patterns\n- ✅ Added Notes about resolver naming conventions\n\n### Implementation Patterns Used\n\nAll resolvers follow district-registry conventions:\n\n1. **Pagination:** Uses existing `paged-query` helper function\n2. **Error Handling:** Wraps queries in `try-catch-throw`\n3. **Enum Conversion:** Uses `enum` helper (alias for `graphql-utils/kw->gql-name`)\n4. **Conditional SQL:** Uses `cond->` with `sqlh/merge-where` and `sqlh/merge-order-by`\n5. **Namespacing:** Resolver functions use kebab-case (council-seat-query-resolver)\n6. **Computed Fields:** Field resolvers calculate derived values (percentages, remaining amounts)\n\n### Current Project Status\n\n**Phase 1: Smart Contracts** - ✅ 100% COMPLETE\n- All 4 contracts compile successfully\n- Migration script ready\n\n**Phase 2: Backend** - ✅ 95% COMPLETE\n- ✅ Database Schema: 100% (6 tables with indexes and helpers)\n- ✅ Event Syncer: 100% (18 event handlers integrated)\n- ✅ GraphQL Schema: 100% (8 types, 3 enums, 10 queries)\n- ✅ GraphQL Resolvers: 100% (10 query + 8 field resolvers) **NEW!**\n- ⏳ ARI API: 0% (next priority)\n\n**Phase 3: UI** - ⏳ 0%\n\n### Files Modified This Session\n\n1. **src/district_registry/server/graphql_resolvers.cljs** (643 lines total, +239 new)\n   - Added complete Backroom resolver functions (lines 404-642)\n   - Extended Query map and resolvers-map\n   \n2. **@fix_plan.md**\n   - Marked GraphQL as complete with detailed implementation notes\n   - Added 3 new Key Learnings about GraphQL patterns\n\n### Next Steps\n\nAccording to @fix_plan.md, the next priority is:\n\n**ARI API (Phase 2 - Backend)**\n- Create `src/district_registry/server/ari_api.cljs` with read endpoints\n- Add ARI signature verification\n- Add write endpoints for proposals\n\nThis will enable ARI (The Stranger) to:\